Custom React Query hook for fetching and managing menu data, providing `useAllMenuItems()` and `useAllMenuItemCategories()`.

Implement ONLY the file described in the role above. Follow the feature instruction for context on how other files in the feature work and what they expect from this file. Do not implement other files' content.

