   nothing, so importing it can never create a cycle.
8. LOCAL IMPORTS ARE A CLOSED SET — THE MODULE CATALOG IS EXHAUSTIVE: when a "MODULES THAT
   ALREADY EXIST" section is present in your dependency context, it lists every local module
